WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
Such heavy rain

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,120
How dare you paddle back alone?

3
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:03,400
Not afraid of capsizing

4
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,160
I just thought it would be inconvenient to go out in the future.

5
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,640
I brought all the cash at home today

6
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:08,000
I will change as much as I can.

7
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,360
Who knew it would rain heavily again halfway?

8
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,480
By the way, it's so late, why haven't you slept?

9
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,680
Both of these families live on the fifth floor

10
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,920
The rain was still light when we came back

11
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,280
Who knew it would suddenly rain heavily again at night?

12
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,400
They are afraid that the water will continue to rise

13
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,520
Just ask us to come down and discuss what to do

14
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:21,880
The water surface just now

15
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,280
It's already flush with the windows between the fourth and fifth floors.

16
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:31,610
It's really not possible to be only more than one meter away from the fifth floor.

17
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:34,210
You can only go to the corridor of a higher floor to make do with it.

18
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:35,840
I can move it when I go to class.

19
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,840
There is no way to put things in the corridor.

20
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,000
It also affects other people’s access

21
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:43,400
Everyone saw the commotion that the 102 family caused when they blocked someone's door.

22
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:44,720
We don't want to cause trouble to others either.

23
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:48,220
The fifth floor is no longer safe

24
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,740
You decide for yourself whether to move or not.

25
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,580
We can use our hands to move it.

26
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:54,020
As for whether the rescue team will come tomorrow, no one can say for sure.

27
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:55,860
Let's help Miss Shen deliver the things up first.

28
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:57,220
You haven't decided yet when you get back.

29
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:58,420
Everyone goes back to their homes to rest.
